{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hambagu Shop</strong> is a\u00a0cozy horror simulator where you work in a Japanese Hamburg Steak Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mari, who inherits her late grandfather\u2019s Hamburg Shop, and she must learn to tend and care for the shop to keep the business thriving,\u00a0no matter what the cost...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill Hamburg patties, stack them on top of fragrant rice, and add additional toppings before serving this delicious Hamburg Ricebowl to your lovely customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ccf863b475e653462f2cfd0abd90d7bd.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ccf863b475e653462f2cfd0abd90d7bd.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ccf863b475e653462f2cfd0abd90d7bd.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow your shop, you will unlock a variety of sides dishes and beverages, with increasingly complex recipes to satisfy the unique tastes of your regular customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/7bd579cdb5ac4e864ac603f5ef7d1759.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/7bd579cdb5ac4e864ac603f5ef7d1759.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/7bd579cdb5ac4e864ac603f5ef7d1759.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrading your shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to run a successful business, you need to reinvest your profits into The Hambagu Shop to make even more money. That is probably the point of running a business anyway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/773bd9d519480eb5ff55c0c566d5107c.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/773bd9d519480eb5ff55c0c566d5107c.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/773bd9d519480eb5ff55c0c566d5107c.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not all sunshine and cozy vibes in The Hambagu Shop.\u00a0While serving customers, you may see haunting visions in the shop which led you the believe that the shop is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair warning:</strong> This game is not for the faint of heart. There will be creepy atmosphere, loud jumpscares, and unsettling story that slowly unfolds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/5486856a01668c00d6cbe1ee89343820.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/5486856a01668c00d6cbe1ee89343820.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/5486856a01668c00d6cbe1ee89343820.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: a simple yet engaging loop, grill hamburg, prepare side dishes and serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Aesthetics: Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: Uncover Mari's personal story as she works in a Japanese hamburg Steak shop</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Content Creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991140?t=1774524117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9773b58bbeaa7f21998bb0a23743e8f60a60c513/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774524117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9e96963fdaad8783ebdda3fdbbe9d4842c1b130b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774524117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9e96963fdaad8783ebdda3fdbbe9d4842c1b130b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774524117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hambagu Shop</strong> is a\u00a0cozy horror simulator where you work in a Japanese Hamburg Steak Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mari, who inherits her late grandfather\u2019s Hamburg Shop, and she must learn to tend and care for the shop to keep the business thriving,\u00a0no matter what the cost...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.poster.avif?t=1774524117\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.webm?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/ec433a3643bbd6cbdaf8585f3880dd8b.mp4?t=1774524117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill Hamburg patties, stack them on top of fragrant rice, and add additional toppings before serving this delicious Hamburg Ricebowl to your lovely customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop