onal story as she works in a Japanese hamburg Steak shop</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Content Creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p>","developers":["Mike Ten"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/1bb2584981aeb975d89d87d1cdbc1895e4eeb7a6/header.jpg?t=1774524117","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1999523122/0e7e867cd8e320eec0d2c021907f2cdc423be896/1774523602/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774524116","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1999523122/0e7e867cd8e320eec0d2c021907f2cdc423be896/1774523602/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774524116","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1999523122/0e7e867cd8e320eec0d2c021907f2cdc423be896/1774523602/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774524116","id":257309411,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257309411/a7280bf5c1f93f6f592360390f8631d597e9879c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774524116"}],"name":"The Hambagu Shop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750ti or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:<