 Hambagu Shop is a\u00a0cozy horror simulator where you work in a Japanese Hamburg Steak Shop. Cook Hamburg, serve customers, and upgrade your shop for more menu items.","steam_appid":3991140,"support_info":{"email":"mike@miketengames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":null}